{
  "kind": "Tabs",
  "description": "A Tabs widget: Component{Type:Tab} owns a Tabs node, which owns one or more Tab panes, each with its own Container content tree. DefaultTab picks which pane shows first.",
  "source_capture": "capture_page_testallbutton_A00_full.json",
  "template": {
    "Container_Sample01": {
      "Id": "Container_Sample01",
      "Kind": "Container",
      "Type": "Component",
      "Name": "Tab",
      "Container::Component": [
        "Component_Sample01"
      ],
      "Container::FieldMapping": [
        "FieldMapping_Sample01"
      ]
    },
    "Component_Sample01": {
      "Id": "Component_Sample01",
      "Kind": "Component",
      "Type": "Tab",
      "Script": {
        "web": "general/tab"
      },
      "Name": "Tab",
      "Page": "Page_Sample01",
      "Data": {
        "manifest_id": "Tab",
        "category": "general",
        "visualization_type": "tab"
      },
      "Container": "Container_Sample01",
      "Component::Tabs": [
        "Tabs_Sample01"
      ]
    },
    "FieldMapping_Sample01": {
      "Id": "FieldMapping_Sample01",
      "Kind": "FieldMapping",
      "Name": "tabType",
      "Container": "Container_Sample01",
      "FieldMapping::Property": [
        "Property_Sample01"
      ]
    },
    "Property_Sample01": {
      "Id": "Property_Sample01",
      "Kind": "Property",
      "Type": "Value",
      "Value": "TYPE1",
      "FieldMapping": "FieldMapping_Sample01"
    },
    "Tabs_Sample01": {
      "Id": "Tabs_Sample01",
      "Kind": "Tabs",
      "Component": "Component_Sample01",
      "Tabs::Tab": [
        "Tab_Sample01"
      ],
      "DefaultTab": "Tab_Sample01"
    },
    "Tab_Sample01": {
      "Id": "Tab_Sample01",
      "Kind": "Tab",
      "Name": "Tab 1",
      "hasBadge": false,
      "Tabs": "Tabs_Sample01",
      "Tab::Container": [
        "Container_Sample02"
      ]
    },
    "Container_Sample02": {
      "Id": "Container_Sample02",
      "Kind": "Container",
      "Type": "Tab",
      "Name": "Tab Container",
      "Tab": "Tab_Sample01",
      "Container::Style": [
        "Style_Sample01"
      ],
      "Container::Container": []
    },
    "Style_Sample01": {
      "Id": "Style_Sample01",
      "Kind": "Style",
      "Container": "Container_Sample02",
      "Value": {}
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "Each Tab's content lives in its OWN Container (Type:\"Tab\") reached via Tab::Container — a fifth distinct Container Type value alongside Body/Container/Component/Popup.",
    "A multi-pane tab widget is just Tabs::Tab holding more than one id, each with its own Tab::Container — DefaultTab still names exactly one of them.",
    "For a CRITERIA-DRIVEN tab switcher (show/hide whole custom-built panes instead of using this native widget) the pattern is different: a PageVariable + one EventMapping per tab button + one Criteria+Condition per pane testing that Variable — see criteria_condition.json. The two approaches are not the same mechanism; this file is the NATIVE Tabs widget."
  ]
}
